{"id":"en_transferred-agony","title":"Transferred Agony","titleEn":"Transferred Agony","description":"Dr. Luna Quinn became the unwitting target of intern Mabel Wells, whose so-called painless medical method covertly redirected patients' suffering onto Luna. The scheme ultimately killed her while Mabel was performing a craniotomy. Given a second chance at life, Luna resolves to act with cold determination. She spends her savings to outbid other patients for a spot under Mabel's care, intending to submit to the same deceptive procedure and finally bring the hidden pain transference to light. Dramzio is where the series can be followed.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/transferred-agony/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/transferred-agony/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Suspense","Elite","Urban","Plot Twists","Out-of-the-Box","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsf5i/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_transferred-agony_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsf5i/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_transferred-agony_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsf5i/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_transferred-agony_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsf5i/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_transferred-agony_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsf5i/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable